# SonoJS charts — locked visual pattern

**Status: LOCKED.** Canonical demo: `registry/charts/bar/simple-bar-chart.tsx`  
**Human checklist:** `registry/charts/PORT.md`  
**Shared chrome:** `registry/charts/_lib/chart-styles.ts`

Do not restyle Simple Bar (or invent a second dual-series look) without an explicit unlock from the user. After any allowed edit: `npm run registry:build`.

## Dual series (do not invent a second pair)

| Token | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| `--chart-1` | `#1E3A8A` navy | `#3B82F6` |
| `--chart-2` | `#EA580C` orange | `#F97316` |

Defined in `app/globals.css` + `styles/vega-tokens.css` and mirrored on `simple-bar-chart` registry `cssVars`. Component source uses CSS vars only — no hex in `simple-bar-chart.tsx`.

`--chart-3…5` = semantic accents only (status / alert), never a third default series for “variety.”

## Chrome (canonical)

- Title bold + muted subtitle; metric header (total + delta + active month); idle = last category
- Grouped flat bars, top radius `8`, width 36/28, category gap 18%/16%, barGap 8/6
- Scrub: dim inactive 40%; one neutral `foreground` total while scrubbing — never series-colored always-on labels (except chart-local tip labels where the type requires them, e.g. pyramid `%`)
- Horizontal dashed grid only (`4 4`, border @ ~0.4 opacity)
- No axis / tick lines; axis ticks via foreground mix; no rotated Y unit label
- Legend: bottom center, `size-2` rounded-full dots (HTML outside SVG)
- Tooltip: `ChartTooltip` + `ChartTooltipContent` (`rounded-xl`)
- `useChartDir` + LTR data; RTL flips layout only
- `accessibilityLayer` + keyboard `aria-live` + `sr-only` table
- `prefers-reduced-motion` → no / zero-duration animation; no idle pulse

## When porting

Match this pattern first. Deviate only when the chart type cannot (heatmap, sparkline, etc.) — and say so in the PR.
